{
  "meta": {
    "description": "公开详情富文本过滤（site.application.RichTextSanitizer）黄金向量。全部为合成值，域名使用保留的 .test 顶级域；没有可用的脱敏真实样本，覆盖范围与未覆盖项见 docs/architecture/07-rich-text-filter.md 第 6 节。",
    "image_config": {
      "base_url": "https://www.maccms.test/",
      "protocol": "https",
      "mode": "local",
      "remoteurl": "",
      "img_key": "cdn[.]maccms[.]test",
      "img_api": "/img.php?url="
    },
    "verification": "expect 为新版输出的完整 HTML（逐字比较），findings 为 RichTextSanitizer.Finding 集合。RichTextSanitizerGoldenTest 另对每条向量断言：再过滤一次结果不变（稳定）、jsoup 重新解析后只含白名单元素与属性、URL 属性都能通过 SafeUrl。"
  },
  "vectors": [
    {
      "id": "tag/script",
      "input": "<script>alert(1)</script><p>x</p>",
      "expect": "<p>x</p>",
      "findings": [
        "DANGEROUS_ELEMENT_REMOVED"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "tag/script-uppercase-src",
      "input": "<SCRIPT SRC=//evil.test/x.js></SCRIPT>正文",
      "expect": "正文",
      "findings": [
        "DANGEROUS_ELEMENT_REMOVED"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "tag/script-unclosed",
      "input": "<p>前</p><script>alert(1)",
      "expect": "<p>前</p>",
      "findings": [
        "DANGEROUS_ELEMENT_REMOVED"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "tag/script-split-name",
      "input": "<scr<script>ipt>alert(1)</script>",
      "expect": "ipt&gt;alert(1)",
      "findings": [
        "ELEMENT_UNWRAPPED"
      ],
      "note": "HTML5 解析出名为 scr<script 的未知元素（去标签），其余是普通文字，没有 script 元素"
    },
    {
      "id": "tag/svg-script",
